{"metas":[{"id":"tt0479336","type":"series","name":"Pinoy Big Brother","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t77HwrtME1Pupc56Ftdb283uUYM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/nCXV9ARvIE2Yc9tLg6pBwpPpPld.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2005"},{"id":"tt6556992","type":"series","name":"Hot Ones","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uudasFgKCVQFNGqfanD6wEGVS1.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/iNt4CmfX70UlqFG6Ixxnhto3IOA.jpg","description":"Des stars répondent à des questions tout en dégustant des ailes de poulet de plus en plus épicées.","releaseInfo":"2015"},{"id":"tt0466513","type":"series","name":"Jornal Nacional","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0x9tcHp8SV8UH4yq40g5zu6phu.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/m9lBl3aEn2nGt8qHQYL2sIJbvcB.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"1969"},{"id":"tt3833900","type":"series","name":"In aller Freundschaft - Die jungen Ärzte","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNGHuwsxs6KlwymfgOdPKisfBBe.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/bnGFjtkk4EXXd7R7yNvJX5UOX3E.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2015"},{"id":"tt5467444","type":"series","name":"Suidooster","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sS0N6EfeaeykTpvVwIDEtB07SNr.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ynd225o8GuCahYGjHtFdEt8Xizm.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2015"},{"id":"tt26598805","type":"series","name":"Nocturne","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwoPlr2g3moHYZH05DyRZVgUf6m.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/614k6C9doThoMe6GyH0nTnGgLXt.jpg","description":"Lorsqu’une victime du célèbre tueur en série Jurek Walter refait surface en vie, l’enquêteur Jonah Lynn entame une course contre la montre pour retrouver sa dernière proie encore portée disparue. Sa protégée Saga Bauer travaille sous couverture pour faire parler le tueur.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt32375763","type":"series","name":"12 12 12","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awWRxpVXFJGbumYp7OM0slCjzRG.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/tjy25xpiFeo2gahl7N0hoxbRtG7.jpg","description":"Un braquage prend 12 mois à préparer, 12 heures à mettre à exécution, et un braqueur qui n'est pas arrêté dans les 12 jours ne le sera jamais. Dans un chassé-croisé haletant de trois temporalités, un agent du FBI et un criminel de carrière se livrent à un jeu dangereux du chat et de la souris, à travers l'Europe.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt39123061","type":"series","name":"The Ramparts of Ice","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spPKOGhjNrOZuCUoTOzg0Q05Mum.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ht6WUmez8cFbwlrFmGdjbYyn3RG.jpg","description":"Hantée par des souvenirs envahissants, Koyuki Hikawa préfère rester dans sa bulle jusqu'au jour où trois camarades de lycée décident de l'aider à s'ouvrir aux autres.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt0267212","type":"series","name":"Question Time","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLGgjwQNnCKuDdJMDmp02pxB0u9.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5EZwuwszeei0vDQzdxWTCWKQKtq.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"1979"},{"id":"tt0403806","type":"series","name":"De Slimste Mens ter Wereld","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UdVk8oKB3TbBDGRlB0dSzVyf8F.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ekn5C01gRQYwPC69LU7XlXk1EXA.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2003"},{"id":"tt20872936","type":"series","name":"Pushpa Impossible","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jInpgPiN2KnTFAu2mtIbFJtFp7A.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4vw2auyqSnxlXRb0NP1Z3nZ59TP.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt22325164","type":"series","name":"La vengeance de Jana","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y656ZhHU2Hh3bmC5vBtMa2vKpUM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1bUJrX1j5FepXrGM4cOX7vjfsjm.jpg","description":"En 1913, le monde s'apprête à basculer dans le chaos. Au château de La Promesa, propriété des marquis de Luján, Jana, qui vient d'être engagée, veut se venger de ceux qui ont causé la mort de sa mère et retrouver son frère disparu.","releaseInfo":"2023"},{"id":"tt1410219","type":"series","name":"SOKO Stuttgart","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eu50QVZd1b7itOI76oKPUR0Eqvl.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3ysuWbjXP79zQZ546617cBhc31j.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2009"},{"id":"tt30461072","type":"series","name":"Natural High","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtW4geMnFX2YCx6n3Ao0LkR14Hu.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/kQ58qbyCGkdmqKZtxMZbLNpgSxX.jpg","description":"Rejoignez Shen Teng et ses amis alors qu'ils s'éloignent des villes surpeuplées et animées pour renouer avec la beauté de la nature sauvage.","releaseInfo":"2023"},{"id":"tt1441404","type":"series","name":"Al Fondo Hay Sitio","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BkYVoybIvM2U7zeg2JTT5M5dwF.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9kGfwwA0N0KOen7oTBGSVoQsXLz.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2009"},{"id":"tt0940902","type":"series","name":"Notruf Hafenkante","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JSNSFn5vIIkdZnshTbNra4bcrZ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/pJuH3WLjEqIrsztrV9t8a0lmRS7.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2007"},{"id":"tt30002038","type":"series","name":"Sueños de libertad","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LFA0eALDUdv1hdrGNE3ZWEN5f7.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/qwoFxyMtArLpZZzG3mmRDEjGgCM.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt1745739","type":"series","name":"Las Fierbinţi","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZJlqFWGm46PxSkPLteOeV6PIbT.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/rVHaHfV36XiLh4sRxB20RGFy4S0.jpg","description":null,"releaseInfo":"2012"},{"id":"tt0072584","type":"series","name":"Wheel of Fortune","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4S36URhKU4sBL1gC2B5UxmTlZMl.jpg","background":"https://image